OL,3,GNEWSATeen fire death case against mum
OL,4,Aand brother ends
OL,5,
OL,6,FManslaughter charges against the mother
OL,7,Fand brother of a teenager who died in a
OL,8,Fhouse fire have ended after prosecution
OL,9,Fexperts changed their minds.
OL,11,FDanielle Johnson, 44, and Louis Casson,
OL,12,F20, had been due to stand trial accused
OL,13,Fof killing Leah Casson, 18, who died at
OL,14,Fthe family's home on Vicarage Street in
OL,15,FNorth Shields on 16 January 2023.
OL,17,FAhead of the trial beginning at
OL,18,FNewcastle Crown Court, prosecutors said
OL,19,Fthe manslaughter charge against them
OL,20,Fand a third man, Calvin Smith, 38,
OL,21,Fwould be discontinued, with not guilty
OL,22,Fverdicts recorded.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
